    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The tax-software giant wielding the axe has unveiled a painful but necessary reinvention, a familiar corporate alibi for mass layoffs. The chief executive enforcing the cut announced a workforce reduction that will erase 3,000 livelihoods on the altar of efficiency. To soften the blow, the company offered a severance package meant to buy out loyalty, a calculated move from a technology company chasing the AI hype at human cost.",
